      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 1,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "The White Knights' Order always acts as a team,\r\nwhich often leads to underestimation of\r\nindividual abilities.",
        "Jp" : "白衛騎士団はいつも隊として行動するせいか\r\n個人の力を見くびられがちだと感じている"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 397996,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 2,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "However, each elite individual in the Knights' Order, who has trained both their mind and body, comes together and unleashes even greater power.\r\nThat is what the Knights' Order is.\r\nIt would be troubling if you were to underestimate us.",
        "Jp" : "だが、心身ともに鍛練を積んだ精鋭一人一人が\r\n結束してさらに力を発揮する――\r\nそれが騎士団なのだ\r\n甘く見てもらっては困る"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 398443,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    } ],
    "NameDispOff" : false,
    "NpcId" : 2403,
