      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 3,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "The mission this time was supposed to be a mixed\r\nformation of Arisen and Knight members, but in\r\nreality, almost all of them are Arisen.",
        "Jp" : "今回の任務は\r\n覚者と騎士団員の混合編成だと聞いていたが\r\n実際はほとんどが覚者か"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 397997,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 4,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "I suppose there is something to be said for\r\nhaving the appropriate personnel, but personally,\r\nI would have found it easier to have a few\r\nmore Knights around.",
        "Jp" : "適正というものがあってのことなのだろうが\r\n俺としてはもう少し騎士団員がいた方が\r\n何かと動きやすかったな――"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 397998,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 5,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "However, on the other hand, it means that I am\r\nexpected to work just as well as an Arisen.\r\nWatch the labor of the White Knights' Order.",
        "Jp" : "だが――裏を返せば、俺は覚者に劣らぬ働きを\r\n期待されているということ\r\n白衛騎士団の働き、見てろよ"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 397999,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    } ],
